    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "friends and doctors don't get it though. they tell me \"it gets better\" but it doesn't. the house is just a museum of everything i lost. sometimes i look at his side of the bed and i just feel like i'm already gone, just waiting to actually catch up to him. it feels more like a burden to stay than to leave.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
